{%- comment -%}
  Stat icons.

  Drawn rather than sourced: an icon set pulled off a CDN brings its own
  drawing conventions — rounded caps, 2px strokes, 24px grids — and NON has
  none of those. These follow the brand instead:

    · 1px strokes, never filled. The page is type and photography; a solid
      glyph would be the heaviest thing in the band and outweigh the number
      it belongs to.
    · Butt caps and mitre joins. No rounded corners anywhere — the same rule
      the favicon note records for the NON mark.
    · currentColor, so an icon inherits whatever ink the section is using and
      cannot go black-on-black the way the About caption did.
    · A 24-unit square viewBox, sized in CSS, so one icon is never a different
      optical weight to the next.

  usage: {% render 'stat-icon', icon: b.settings.icon %}
  Anything unrecognised — including the default 'none' — renders nothing at
  all, so a stat without an icon is a stat without an icon, not a broken box.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case icon -%}

  {%- when 'water' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A droplet, for water saved. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 3 L18 12.2 A6 6 0 1 1 6 12.2 Z"/>
      <path d="M9 13.4 a3 3 0 0 0 3 3"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'energy' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A bolt, for green energy. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M13.5 2.5 L6 13.5 h5 l-.5 8 L18 10.5 h-5 z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'zero' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A glass with the level struck through — 0.0%. A plain "no entry" circle
      would read as a prohibition, which is the opposite of the point: the
      bottle is full, the alcohol is what is absent.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M6.5 3 h11 l-1.2 8.2 a4.4 4.4 0 0 1-8.6 0 z"/>
      <path d="M12 15.6 V21"/>
      <path d="M8.5 21 h7"/>
      <path d="M4 6.6 L20 17.4"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'leaf' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A leaf, for anything about growing or sourcing. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M20 4 C10 4 4 9 4 15 a5 5 0 0 0 5 5 c6 0 11-6 11-16 z"/>
      <path d="M20 4 L7.5 17"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'ship' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A carton, for shipping and packaging claims. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M3 7.6 L12 3 l9 4.6 v8.8 L12 21 L3 16.4 z"/>
      <path d="M3 7.6 L12 12.2 L21 7.6"/>
      <path d="M12 12.2 V21"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'star' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A star, for the Michelin lineage. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 2.6 L14.6 9.2 L21.5 9.6 L16.2 14 L17.9 20.7 L12 17 L6.1 20.7 L7.8 14 L2.5 9.6 L9.4 9.2 Z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'table' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A plate with a glass beside it — built for the table. A plate alone reads
      as food; the glass next to it is the whole argument.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="9" cy="13" r="6.4"/>
      <circle cx="9" cy="13" r="3.2"/>
      <path d="M17.6 4.4 h4 l-.5 5.2 a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-3 0 z"/>
      <path d="M19.6 11 V20"/>
      <path d="M17.6 20 h4"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'scale' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A balance, for structure over sweetness. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 3 V20"/>
      <path d="M6 20 h12"/>
      <path d="M4 7 h16"/>
      <path d="M4 7 L1.6 13 a2.6 2.6 0 0 0 4.8 0 z"/>
      <path d="M20 7 L17.6 13 a2.6 2.6 0 0 0 4.8 0 z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'fruit' -%}
    {%- comment -%} A whole fruit with a leaf — the raw material. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="14.4" r="7"/>
      <path d="M12 7.4 V3.2"/>
      <path d="M12 5.6 C14.4 3.2 17.2 3 18.4 3.2 C18.4 5 17 7 12 7.4 Z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'tannin' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A leaf in a cup — tannin comes from tea, skins and pith, i.e. something
      steeped. A bare leaf would read as "natural", which is not the claim.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 9.5 h13 v4.2 a6.5 6.5 0 0 1-13 0 z"/>
      <path d="M17 10.6 h1.8 a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 4.8 h-.5"/>
      <path d="M10.5 6.6 c0-1.6 1.2-2.6 2.4-3"/>
      <path d="M7 6.6 c0-1.6 1.2-2.6 2.4-3"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'palate' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A filled wine glass, for TASTES. The liquid line is what makes it about
      flavour rather than serving — an empty glass is the 'serve' idea.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M6.5 3 h11 l-1 7.2 a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-9 0 z"/>
      <path d="M6.9 6.4 h10.2"/>
      <path d="M12 14.7 V21"/>
      <path d="M8.4 21 h7.2"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'seat' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A place setting seen from above — plate between knife and fork — for
      SITS WITH, which is about the seat at the table this bottle takes.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.2"/>
      <path d="M3 4.5 V11 M4.6 4.5 V11 M3.8 11 V19.5"/>
      <path d="M20.2 4.5 c1.4 1.4 1.4 5.2 0 6.4 V19.5"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'nutrition' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A panel — ruled rows in a box, the shape of a nutrition table. Not a
      heart and not a flame: this cell states figures, it makes no health
      claim, and an icon that implies one would be a claim nobody wrote.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M4 3 h16 v18 h-16 z"/>
      <path d="M4 8 h16"/>
      <path d="M7 12 h10 M7 15.5 h10 M7 18.2 h6"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'serve' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      An empty glass with a chill mark — SERVE is temperature and vessel.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M7.6 8.5 h8.8 l-.9 6.4 a3.6 3.6 0 0 1-7 0 z"/>
      <path d="M12 18.6 V21"/>
      <path d="M9 21 h6"/>
      <path d="M12 2 V7 M10 3.4 L12 5 L14 3.4"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'bottle' -%}
    {%- comment -%} The bottle itself, for anything about the liquid. {%- endcomment -%}
    <svg class="non-stat__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
         stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M10 2.5 h4 v4 l2.4 3.2 V21 h-8.8 V9.7 L10 6.5 z"/>
      <path d="M7.6 13.5 h8.8"/>
    </svg>

{%- endcase -%}
